l beauty that’s hard to find. A gazebo & cabana overlook the ravine, a hidden playhouse sits tucked amongst the trees & at the heart of it all lies a stone-tiled swimming pool & hot tub creating a resort-style retreat. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$4,295,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","5"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","4,191 sq ft"],["Lot size","17,230 sq ft"],["Year built","1981"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Westbrook Estate"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6J0N3"],["MLS® number","E4512247"],["Listed","October 8, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Water softener, Central Vacuum, Gas stove(s), Dishwasher, Dryer, Microwave, Freezer, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s), Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air, In Floor Heating"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, See Remarks, Heated Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","7.49 m × 6.75 m (24'7\" × 22'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","5.75 m × 5.28 m (18'10\" × 17'4\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.63 m × 4.34 m (18'6\" × 14'3\")"],["Family room","Main level","5.31 m × 3.93 m (17'5\" × 12'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","7.03 m × 4.54 m (23'1\" × 14'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.52 m × 4.24 m (14'10\" × 13'11\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.42 m × 3.37 m (11'3\" × 11'1\")"],["Bedroom 4","Upper Level","3.40 m × 3.40 m (11'2\" × 11'2\")"],["Office","Main level","7.16 m × 3.60 m (23'6\" × 11'10\")"],["Recreation room","Upper Level","4.49 m × 3.42 m (14'9\" × 11'3\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","7.79 m × 3.53 m (25'7\" × 11'7\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","4.01 m × 3.45 m (13'2\" × 11'4\")"],["Laundry room","Upper Level","3.20 m × 1.98 m (10'6\" × 6'6\")"],["Mud room","Main level","3.96 m × 2.51 m (13'0\" × 8'3\")"]],"courtesy":"Kerri-lyn Holland, REMAX River City and Jason Holland, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS®